1
00:00:00,356 --> 00:00:02,856
(Sheldon:)Seriously?

2
00:00:02,859 --> 00:00:04,329
(Sheldon:)He invented the Rubik's Cube.

3
00:00:04,327 --> 00:00:06,457
(Penny:)Okay, fine,

4
00:00:06,462 --> 00:00:08,132
(Penny:)but why would you invite him
to our wedding?

5
00:00:08,131 --> 00:00:10,431
(Sheldon:)Because, despite his fame
and fortune,

6
00:00:10,433 --> 00:00:12,933
(Sheldon:)he strikes me as a lonely man.

7
00:00:12,935 --> 00:00:15,135
(Bernadette:)Well, it's very sweet

8
00:00:15,138 --> 00:00:17,338
(Bernadette:)of you to go to all this trouble
for Leonard's mother.

9
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:18,940
(Penny:)Yeah, I'm also doing it
for Leonard.

10
00:00:18,941 --> 00:00:20,971
(Penny:)I think this could really help
their relationship.

11
00:00:20,977 --> 00:00:24,147
(Beverly:)How dare you invite your father
without consulting me!

12
00:00:26,849 --> 00:00:29,149
(Leonard:)Sorry, but I don't think
I need your permission

13
00:00:29,152 --> 00:00:31,282
(Leonard:)to have my father at my wedding.

14
00:00:31,287 --> 00:00:33,817
(Beverly:)You do understand our marriage
ended because he had an affair.

15
00:00:33,823 --> 00:00:34,893
(Leonard:)I know,

16
00:00:34,891 --> 00:00:36,961
(Leonard:)and there's no excuse for that.

17
00:00:36,959 --> 00:00:40,529
(Beverly:)He claimed I was cold,
emasculating,

18
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:43,360
(Beverly:)and hadn't shown him any
physical affection for years.

19
00:00:43,366 --> 00:00:46,866
(Leonard:)I was wrong, there's
three excuses for that.

20
00:00:57,513 --> 00:00:59,543
(Howard:)Oh, my God.

21
00:00:59,549 --> 00:01:00,479
(Howard:)It's working.

